  "schema:identifier": "id-a996a76d1225505098286f98eb10d686",
  "schema:name": "SF Reporting Application Cooperation View",
  "schema:description": "Application cooperation and data exchange view for substandard and falsified medical product reporting (Section 1.3, Table 4, Section 3.2, Section 4.4, Table 11, Ch. 7; PDF 22, 24, 33-34, 42-43, 59): SF Reporting Application, NMRA Case Management Back End, Pharmacovigilance System, SF Report Data Object (SFR.A1.DE1..DE10, linked to Trade Item and Traceability Event), Product Verification, shared DPI-H registries (Product Registry, DPI-H Health Workforce Registry, Facility registry, Terminology Service) via the Interoperability Component, and external WHO systems (WHO GSMS, VigiFlow / VigiBase, WHO Medical Product Alert System).",
